  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Development Objective (Note: will be disclosed in the MOS)The Project development objective is to reduce trade transaction costs along the Abidjan-Ouagadougou corridorBoard Schedule CommentsThe activity proposes a potential regional DPO that would provide budget support to Burkina Faso and Cote d&apos;Ivoire.  It would the second operations of 2-year series.</narrative>
  </description>
